@startuml SSD_ConsultRecoveryRoom
title SSD: UC12 - Consult Recovery Room

actor "Nurse" as Nurse
participant ":System" as System

autonumber
activate Nurse

Nurse -> System: requests the list of users in the recovery room
activate System

alt recovery room is empty
    System --> Nurse: displays "The recovery room is empty" message
else recovery room has users
    System --> Nurse: displays the list of users in FIFO order (SNS Number and Name)
end

deactivate System
deactivate Nurse
@enduml
